span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Past Tense </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to decide\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"decided\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to start\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" started\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to take\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" took\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to leave\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" left\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to say\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" said\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to go\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" went\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" told\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Travel and Transportation"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Here are some useful modes of transportation."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Mode of Transportation </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> You go ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> You travel ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walking<br /> bike, bicycle<br /> subway<br /> bus<br /> car<br /> airplane<br /> train<br /> boat<br /> ship\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on foot<br /> on a bike, bicycle<br /> in a subway<br /> in a bus<br /> in a car<br /> in an airplane<br /> on a train<br /> on a boat<br /> on a ship\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on foot<br /> by bike, bicycle<br />by subway by bus<br /> by car<br /> by airplane<br /> by train<br /> by boat<br /> by ship\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "prawn"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of seafood"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Prawns are similar to shrimp."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le04ob02aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose 3 forms of transportation, such as a taxi."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss the good and bad things about each form. Make a list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For each form, think of a situation where it is the best way to travel.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write your answers in sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I discuss transportation with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write the good and bad things about 3 forms of transportation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 5 sentences about transportation."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le04ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le04ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le04ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hello, this is Vanessa. I'm sorry I missed your call. Please leave a message after the beep and I'll get back to yo